         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Opposite Associations Between the rs3845446 Single-Nucleotide Polymorphism of the CACNA1E Gene and Postoperative Pain-Related Phenotypes in Gastrointestinal Surgery Versus Previously Reported Orthognathic Surgery</rdf:li>
